flowchart LR
    subgraph Browser ["Customer Browser & SPA"]
        EventTrigger["User Action (PageView, AddToCart, Purchase)"]
        EventIdGen["Deterministic UUID event_id Generation"]
        MetaPixel["Meta Pixel (Browser Event)"]
        GA4Tag["GA4 gtag.js (Browser Event)"]
    end

    subgraph Server ["CENTERPOINT Backend Engine"]
        ServerIngress["POST /api/v1/marketing/events"]
        ConsentCheck{"Google Consent Mode v2 Validation"}
        Dispatcher["EventDispatcherService (Queue/Sync)"]
        PIIHasher["SHA-256 PII Hasher (email, phone, city)"]
        MetaCAPI["Meta Conversions API Adapter"]
        AttributionLog[("order_attributions (UTM, gclid, fbclid)")]
    end

    subgraph External ["Ad & Analytics Platforms"]
        MetaServers["Meta Event Gateway (Deduplication via event_id)"]
        GoogleServers["Google Analytics 4 & Google Ads"]
    end

    EventTrigger --> EventIdGen
    EventIdGen --> MetaPixel
    EventIdGen --> GA4Tag
    EventIdGen --> ServerIngress

    MetaPixel -.->|Browser Signal| MetaServers
    GA4Tag -.->|Browser Signal| GoogleServers

    ServerIngress --> ConsentCheck
    ConsentCheck -->|Consented| Dispatcher
    Dispatcher --> PIIHasher
    PIIHasher --> MetaCAPI
    MetaCAPI -->|Server CAPI Payload| MetaServers
    Dispatcher --> AttributionLog
